        "comments": "The assembly ddRhoPont1.hap1.2 is based on 75x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Order and orientation of scaffolds on Chromosome 1 from\n34.63-34.88Mb and Chromosome 3 from\n49.07-60.34Mb is unsure. There are haplotypic inversions on Chromosome 1 from\n37.03-37.83Mb, Chromosome 2 from\n61.46-63.59Mb, Chromosome 7 from\n8.34-13.41Mb and Chromosome 11 from\n23.39-25.16Mb",
